Id: 7c5438c7-d657-4a6e-a5bf-46f611e556f1
Name: "PVX: Blank Game"
Scope: Session
Description: A clean, minimal PVX game — the PVX runtime booted, nothing else.
FullDescription: Boots the real PVX runtime (PVXGame, PVXGameplayFeature) with a basic scene, camera and renderer. No gameplay systems are pre-wired beyond the runtime itself — add PVXInteractionFeature, PVX.World, PVX.FirstPerson, etc. as your game needs them.
Group: PVX
DefaultOutputName: PvxGame
